{
    "title": "Stopfinder",
    "description": "For participating Districts, Stopfinder gives parents and guardians access to view and share their student\u2019s bus stop assignments as well as communicate with the Transportation Department.\r\n\r\nWith Stopfinder GeoAlerts, app users can create alert zones at any stop or school or along your student\u2019s route. Stopfinder users will be notified when their student\u2019s bus has arrived at or departed from an alert zone. Know where the bus is and know your student has arrived at or departed from any location along their assigned bus route.\r\n\r\nStopfinder Forms allows app users to complete electronic forms sent from their district through the Stopfinder app. Stopfinder users can view new forms and submitted forms through the Stopfinder Message Center. \r\n\r\nEstimated Time of Arrival (ETA) notifications can be configured by Stopfinder app users to display the bus\u2019s ETA based on their student\u2019s assigned stop and the bus\u2019s location. ETA notifications appear on the student\u2019s schedule in the Stopfinder app and inform users the amount of time until the bus arrives at their student\u2019s assigned stop. \r\n\r\nControl who can see your student\u2019s assigned trip stops.\r\n\r\nSend and receive messages from the school district\u2019s Transportation department.",
    "descriptionHTML": "For participating Districts, Stopfinder gives parents and guardians access to view and share their student\u2019s bus stop assignments as well as communicate with the Transportation Department.<br><br>With Stopfinder GeoAlerts, app users can create alert zones at any stop or school or along your student\u2019s route. Stopfinder users will be notified when their student\u2019s bus has arrived at or departed from an alert zone. Know where the bus is and know your student has arrived at or departed from any location along their assigned bus route.<br><br>Stopfinder Forms allows app users to complete electronic forms sent from their district through the Stopfinder app. Stopfinder users can view new forms and submitted forms through the Stopfinder Message Center. <br><br>Estimated Time of Arrival (ETA) notifications can be configured by Stopfinder app users to display the bus\u2019s ETA based on their student\u2019s assigned stop and the bus\u2019s location. ETA notifications appear on the student\u2019s schedule in the Stopfinder app and inform users the amount of time until the bus arrives at their student\u2019s assigned stop. <br><br>Control who can see your student\u2019s assigned trip stops.<br><br>Send and receive messages from the school district\u2019s Transportation department.",
